We have concentrated the party's focus on the Congreso race in Catalonia, presenting ERC as both the clearest Catalan voice in Madrid and an agent of republican reform. [? if broken_roadmap: Our broken independence roadmap makes it harder to believe, though. ?]

@territorial_networks
title: Coordinate our party's territorial organization
view-if: marta_rovira_advisor or roger_torrent_advisor
choose-if: (marta_rovira_advisor or roger_torrent_advisor) and (erc_advisor_action or party_resources >= 1)
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: [? if not erc_advisor_action: \[-1 resources\] ?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (!Q.erc_advisor_action) Q.party_resources -= 1;
    var effectiveness = Math.max(0, 1 - Q.erc_dissent / 100) * (Q.burdens_broken && (Q.erc_in_gob || Q.erc_supporting) ? 0.3 : 1);
    Q.erc_redbelt_mod += Math.min(Math.max(0, 8 - Q.erc_redbelt_mod), 0.7 * effectiveness);
    Q.erc_interior_mod += Math.min(Math.max(0, 8 - Q.erc_interior_mod), 0.7 * effectiveness);
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to:"erc", from:"psc", amount:(0.25 * effectiveness), maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:"all", demographics:["middle","rural"]});
!}

Thanks to the efforts of [? if marta_rovira_advisor: Marta Rovira ?][? if marta_rovira_advisor and roger_torrent_advisor: and ?][? if roger_torrent_advisor: Roger Torrent ?]our local branches have strengthened their municipal networks. 

