@barcelona_province
title: Campaign with Laporta for Parlament across Barcelona province
view-if: joan_laporta_advisor
choose-if: joan_laporta_advisor and (erc_advisor_action or party_resources >= 1)
subtitle: [? if not erc_advisor_action: \[-1 resources\] ?] 
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.joan_laporta_advisor && (Q.erc_advisor_action || Q.party_resources >= 1)) {
        if (!Q.erc_advisor_action) Q.party_resources -= 1;
        var effectiveness = Math.max(0, 1 - Q.erc_dissent / 100) * (Q.broken_roadmap ? 0.25 : 1);
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to:"erc", from:"ciu", amount:0.8 * effectiveness, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:["barcelona"], demographics:["middle","buss","ind"]});
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, {contest:"parlament", to:"erc", from:"abstain", amount:0.4 * effectiveness, maxDonorFraction:0.5, constituencies:["barcelona"], demographics:["middle","buss","ind"]});
    }
!}

Joan Laporta has taken the flag of our party and our strive for independence and made it heard throughout Barcelona. 

